Maid Kim please

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:30.000
Born under the king's star entered Sosnovy Bor

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:33.790
His father used an ice stone to cast spells

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:37.090
The birth of Chan Wook is the result of this witchcraft

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:39.880
This child is a disaster for Sosnovy Bor

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:42.260
Why do you think Chang Gang did this?

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:45.350
He could make his son king

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:49.980
use the stone to possess Hwansu. He would subjugate the world to himself

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:52.560
Why did he seal his son's gate?

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:54.900
and hid the ice stone?

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:57.900
Because I was weak

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:00.740
He sealed everything and ran away

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:03.160
because he couldn't handle it

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:08.990
Do you think Kil Joo

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:11.710
killed Chang Gang?

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:13.580
If he came back...

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:17.420
Chang Gang wouldn't do something like that openly

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:21.170
I suspect Master Li

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:25.050
We need to gain more strength before the Pine Forest begins to climb

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:29.890
Ten years ago we successfully

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:33.310
got the stone sealed by Chang Gan

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:48.990
You found him

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:51.330
Boo Young,

00:09:51.410 --> 00:09:53.120
give me the ice stone

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:07.010
She was so young, but she was able to find the stone

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:10.470
It must be admitted that her powers were truly amazing.

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:16.600
I heard that Jin Ho Kyung doesn't believe in his daughter's death

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:18.360
and is still looking for her

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:20.610
That's why I want to find her

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:24.900
I will find the daughter she has been looking for for so long.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:28.490
and make Jin Ho Kyung my puppet

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:30.780
How do you find a dead girl?

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.950
I'll find someone

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:37.750
The one who will make Ho Kyung believe that it is Boo Young

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:57.520
Here. Eat

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:06.110
Have you eaten anything since you left Sari Village?

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:15.950
Here

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:19.330
Eat

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:29.550
Take your time

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:32.930
Why is this blind girl sailing alone to the city?

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:34.760
She's looking for a friend

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:38.730
Her friend stole all her things

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:40.810
and fled to the city

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:42.900
Poor girl

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:46.610
Do you know where to go? What's your friend's name?

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:49.820
Moo Deok

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:54.080
My friend's name is Moo Deok

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:57.790
- "Moo Dok"?
- How will she find her?

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:01.750
Sweet toffees!

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:04.290
- Sweet toffees!
- Try our cookies!

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:06.420
Come here! Buy!

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:08.340
Sweet pies!

00:12:08.420 --> 00:12:11.680
The weather is nice, isn't it?

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.890
Mom, buy a pie

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:15.680
I have no money

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:16.970
Mom, buy it!

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:18.350
Well, what are you doing?

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:20.140
Okay, wait

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:24.150
Oh, where are they?

00:12:24.230 --> 00:12:26.610
- Where is my money?
- What's happened?

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:29.150
The money is missing

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:32.110
- What should I do?
- My ring...

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:35.200
- I lost the ring!
- Heaven...

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:06.900
What?

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:10.740
This is all?

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:15.740
The ring is also cheap

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:21.500
I crucified myself there and it was all in vain

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:28.310
- Thank you
- Pour it for me

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:33.280
- Have a nice one
- Thank you

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:14.610
You knew who I was all along

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:18.660
Instead of a friend nearby, you have a whistle

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:21.910
It means your friend left you

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:40.930
Mr. Yul?

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:45.350
Ah, Moo Deok

00:15:46.140 --> 00:15:48.350
Why are you sitting on the street?

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:50.150
Won't you drink?

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:54.690
No. I've had enough

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:57.190
I'm already drunk

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:00.240
And you look good

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:02.780
I'm drunk

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:05.410
so I got lost

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:11.420
I get lost quickly if my head is foggy

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:17.010
How can you get lost here?

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:23.090
Get up, I'll take you home

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:26.760
You got hurt

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:29.350
It's dangerous

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:32.770
Are you scolding me again? Maybe not today?

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:36.440
It's not for me to scold you

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:39.610
I made a mistake myself

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:42.160
Are you?

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:44.160
Yes

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:49.080
I've always done the right thing. Didn't go astray

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:55.960
But I'm lost

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:01.970
And now I'm holding your hand

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:09.220
I don't know where my path will take me

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:16.310
He will lead you with me

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:36.580
Are you holding my hand?

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:39.840
Let's go

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:46.220
You get lost when your head is foggy

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:48.430
All because you think about a lot

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:51.890
When this happens, think about one thing

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:55.560
For example, think about me now

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:08.030
Okay. Now I'll think about you

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:19.630
Mr. So, can I ask you something?

00:18:20.170 --> 00:18:21.130
What's happened?

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:24.970
You said that you dreamed of me

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:26.380
What did my vision tell you?

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:29.220
that you like me

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:32.140
- What?
- What is it?

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:33.890
You repeated this yourself often

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:36.140
Well, that's because...

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:42.400
Was it all a lie?

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:46.400
I like you, but...

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.740
Yes I like you

00:19:18.480 --> 00:19:20.100
My gratitude

00:19:33.990 --> 00:19:35.500
Did he really believe it?

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:39.170
I hope not

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:47.050
Enough is enough

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:49.680
All thanks to you, master

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:52.390
I'm sure Ms. Do Hwa would be happy

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:54.220
Finally I...

00:19:54.310 --> 00:19:58.270
I feel like I did something good for Do Hwa as an apology

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:01.560
You didn't do anything wrong

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:04.940
I was the one who brought her to Sejukwon from my hometown.

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:08.030
That's how she met Chang Gang

00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:11.110
Do Hwa was so kind

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:15.330
I can't believe he believed all this gossip

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:18.120
Chang Gan, such a scoundrel

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:21.710
Master, you're drunk

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:23.210
It's your fault!

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:26.920
What did I do?

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:31.340
I brought Do Hwa to Saejukwon to set you up with her.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:32.340
So what?

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:34.430
Holy heavens

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:37.220
With such looks and skills

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:40.180
can't win a girl's heart?

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:43.270
How annoying you are!

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:46.650
Well, yes

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:49.320
Master Huo helped you so much,

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:51.200
and you didn’t take advantage of a single opportunity

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:53.870
I did

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:56.410
everything I could

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:59.000
I wrote poetry

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:02.330
Gave gifts

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:05.630
But you didn't confess to her

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.210
"I love you"

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:09.670
"Will you be mine?"

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:12.880
Beat around the bush, but didn't say anything

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:16.010
Of course, you lost to the one who said everything straight

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:18.350
Is it necessary to talk openly about feelings?

00:21:20.350 --> 00:21:23.390
Enough hints

00:21:24.190 --> 00:21:25.690
How annoying are you?

00:21:26.310 --> 00:21:28.980
They showed interest, but they kept their distance

00:21:29.070 --> 00:21:30.610
Then they approached again

00:21:30.690 --> 00:21:32.450
You need to tell a woman about your feelings

00:21:32.530 --> 00:21:36.570
This way she can decide whether to wait for you or not.

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:39.950
If love is so fickle only because it has not been expressed out loud,

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:42.210
then I don't need her!

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:47.170
If a woman decides to leave me and go with someone else,

00:21:47.670 --> 00:21:49.130
so be it

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:50.840
"So be it..."

00:21:59.350 --> 00:22:00.640
Continue without me

00:22:02.310 --> 00:22:03.770
Where are you going?

00:22:03.850 --> 00:22:05.900
I'm leaving

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:08.020
Maid Kim

00:22:08.900 --> 00:22:11.980
Stay. Have a drink with us...

00:22:12.070 --> 00:22:13.530
Stay...

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:17.280
Maid Kim, come back, okay?

00:22:17.370 --> 00:22:19.280
- I'll wait
- Well...

00:22:19.370 --> 00:22:21.870
- Maid Kim
- Someday he will regret it

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:23.500
Maid Kim!

00:22:34.380 --> 00:22:37.130
So this is where people drink

00:22:37.220 --> 00:22:39.760
Everyone is waiting for you. Come in

00:22:39.850 --> 00:22:42.060
I can't drink

00:22:42.140 --> 00:22:45.730
I'm out of tea. We must return to Danhyangok

00:22:45.810 --> 00:22:47.560
Get me some food

00:22:47.650 --> 00:22:49.020
Okay

00:22:55.110 --> 00:22:58.610
The smell of women's perfume and the smell of booze

00:23:00.910 --> 00:23:02.790
This is not the place for me

00:23:08.500 --> 00:23:09.790
Loves

00:23:11.960 --> 00:23:13.590
Doesn't like

00:23:15.090 --> 00:23:16.380
Loves

00:23:17.720 --> 00:23:20.550
Doesn't like it. Loves. Doesn't like...

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:23.560
What am I even doing?

00:23:23.640 --> 00:23:25.180
Forget it

00:23:30.270 --> 00:23:33.440
Mommies! What to do now?

00:23:33.520 --> 00:23:34.780
Exactly

00:24:38.590 --> 00:24:40.010
You are a magician, right?

00:24:45.550 --> 00:24:46.560
Master Li?

00:24:47.930 --> 00:24:49.480
Are you Master Li?

00:24:50.430 --> 00:24:54.150
I am a maid of the Chan family. Serving Mr. Chan

00:24:55.440 --> 00:24:56.820
Thank you

00:24:57.400 --> 00:24:58.530
Not worth it

00:25:16.920 --> 00:25:19.050
I guess it got hooked when you caught me

00:25:19.130 --> 00:25:21.880
Wait, let me

00:25:22.550 --> 00:25:24.930
Sorry

00:25:31.680 --> 00:25:32.940
Done

00:25:37.190 --> 00:25:40.280
I've been waiting for you all evening

00:25:40.360 --> 00:25:42.570
to thank

00:25:45.160 --> 00:25:46.410
Like this

00:25:49.410 --> 00:25:50.790
Where did he go?

00:25:51.830 --> 00:25:52.910
Master Li?

00:26:08.800 --> 00:26:11.430
Is it because I haven't had tea for a long time?

00:26:14.600 --> 00:26:17.900
Saejukwon

00:26:19.610 --> 00:26:21.900
Master Huo is not here right now

00:26:21.980 --> 00:26:24.280
But he was waiting for your arrival

00:26:24.990 --> 00:26:26.360
Come on in

00:26:32.500 --> 00:26:35.040
Celebration for the new magician Jeongjingak?

00:26:35.120 --> 00:26:36.710
Master Huo will return drunk

00:26:38.210 --> 00:26:40.540
Everyone knows how grandpa likes to drink

00:26:41.170 --> 00:26:45.090
Madam, maybe we can go to Chwisonra?

00:26:45.880 --> 00:26:48.550
Your future husband will be there

00:26:49.260 --> 00:26:52.260
- What?
- Madam Huo told me everything

00:26:52.350 --> 00:26:56.520
I heard that your grandfather chose several magicians to be your husbands

00:26:56.600 --> 00:26:59.560
Among them is Pak Dan Gu from Sosnovy Bor

00:26:59.650 --> 00:27:01.770
and Seo Yul from the Seo family

00:27:01.860 --> 00:27:04.030
I'm not here for marriage

00:27:04.570 --> 00:27:06.650
I will help in the royal hospital

00:27:06.740 --> 00:27:09.910
Do you think the Crown Prince is on the list too?

00:27:10.700 --> 00:27:13.450
- Your beauty...
- Song Yi!

00:27:13.540 --> 00:27:15.660
Your reasoning has already disgraced me once

00:27:17.410 --> 00:27:18.830
Have you forgotten already?

00:27:18.920 --> 00:27:21.710
Are you talking about that arrogant magician?

00:27:22.380 --> 00:27:25.460
I had to ask the name to tell Master Ho

00:27:27.510 --> 00:27:28.800
Exactly

00:27:29.680 --> 00:27:31.760
I should have asked the name

00:27:34.470 --> 00:27:35.890
Are you okay?

00:27:39.190 --> 00:27:41.060
I wonder if I'll see...

00:27:43.770 --> 00:27:45.150
him again

00:27:49.700 --> 00:27:50.820
Enough is enough

00:27:55.450 --> 00:27:59.620
Uk, you owe me

00:27:59.710 --> 00:28:01.460
so promise

00:28:01.540 --> 00:28:03.920
- Promise what?
- One day,

00:28:04.000 --> 00:28:08.590
when I ask you to do something, you will do it

00:28:09.720 --> 00:28:10.970
Okay, I promise

00:28:11.720 --> 00:28:13.470
Wait a minute

00:28:13.550 --> 00:28:16.810
First I have to clarify something

00:28:16.890 --> 00:28:21.440
I'm asking because you know Master Li

00:28:21.520 --> 00:28:25.440
Have you drunk his chastity tea?

00:28:26.530 --> 00:28:29.740
No. Never. Never drank

00:28:30.360 --> 00:28:32.160
So you're not celibate?

00:28:32.240 --> 00:28:35.580
Of course not. I want to get married someday

00:28:35.660 --> 00:28:37.700
Wonderful. Here

00:28:41.080 --> 00:28:43.080
You are now also a candidate

00:28:43.170 --> 00:28:45.670
You three are candidates

00:28:47.340 --> 00:28:50.090
Don't forget to thank Master Li

00:28:50.170 --> 00:28:53.680
If he hadn't vouched for you, there would have been problems.

00:28:53.760 --> 00:28:55.010
Of course

00:28:55.100 --> 00:28:58.560
You've already cast doubt on people by showing Tansu

00:28:58.640 --> 00:29:00.810
which was owned by Nak Su

00:29:00.890 --> 00:29:04.150
Wook even wanted to become Nak Soo's student

00:29:06.980 --> 00:29:09.190
What are you talking about?

00:29:10.320 --> 00:29:11.150
What?

00:29:13.700 --> 00:29:17.490
He was upset that no one could open his gates,

00:29:18.120 --> 00:29:19.790
that's why I joked like that

00:29:20.580 --> 00:29:22.330
Are you true

00:29:23.540 --> 00:29:25.210
did he say that?

00:29:25.290 --> 00:29:27.340
Yes, it's true

00:29:28.460 --> 00:29:30.800
Yul, tell them

00:29:30.880 --> 00:29:34.470
what is the punishment for magicians who are addicted to dark magic?

00:29:34.550 --> 00:29:36.970
You can lose all your energy

00:29:37.050 --> 00:29:38.600
not being able to cast spells

00:29:38.680 --> 00:29:40.430
Then they will be expelled from Deho,

00:29:41.560 --> 00:29:43.810
and descendants will never be able to become magicians

00:29:43.890 --> 00:29:45.100
Remember this

00:29:48.020 --> 00:29:51.570
Don't ever say that again

00:29:52.490 --> 00:29:54.610
Why is dark magic bad?

00:29:55.360 --> 00:29:56.370
What?

00:29:56.450 --> 00:29:58.450
Regular spells kill people too

00:29:58.530 --> 00:30:00.950
And dark magic can sometimes save lives

00:30:01.830 --> 00:30:03.830
How to separate one from the other,

00:30:03.910 --> 00:30:07.790
you need to think about human intentions, this is more important

00:30:07.880 --> 00:30:11.170
So you would use this magic

00:30:12.460 --> 00:30:14.970
what if it saves someone's life?

00:30:15.050 --> 00:30:17.010
If this magic saves someone,

00:30:18.680 --> 00:30:21.220
I don't see any problem

00:30:27.900 --> 00:30:31.150
Puppy! How dare you!

00:30:31.230 --> 00:30:32.940
You are the magician of Jeongjingak

00:30:33.030 --> 00:30:36.160
How dare you say that you would use this magic?

00:30:36.240 --> 00:30:38.490
If you're going to act like this,

00:30:38.570 --> 00:30:41.120
give back the energy I gave you

00:30:43.330 --> 00:30:45.410
- Chapter
- What is it?

00:30:45.500 --> 00:30:48.540
The Crown Prince is heading here to meet Chan Wook

00:30:53.960 --> 00:30:55.260
Your Highness

00:30:57.430 --> 00:30:58.510
Hello

00:31:14.150 --> 00:31:17.530
Crown Prince! Say hello to him!

00:31:35.340 --> 00:31:37.590
Came here after hearing about the celebration

00:31:37.670 --> 00:31:39.470
But it seems I ruined it

00:31:40.720 --> 00:31:44.100
Come to think of it, it's all thanks to me

00:31:45.220 --> 00:31:47.560
I must be an honored guest

00:31:48.190 --> 00:31:49.770
Why did the mood deteriorate so much?

00:31:50.650 --> 00:31:52.730
I'm sure deep down

00:31:52.820 --> 00:31:55.610
you were hoping it would be my funeral and not a holiday

00:31:55.690 --> 00:31:57.190
So the only thing I can do is

00:31:57.280 --> 00:31:59.450
greet you calmly

00:32:05.450 --> 00:32:07.160
Funeral or holiday

00:32:07.250 --> 00:32:09.460
there's always booze there

00:32:10.250 --> 00:32:13.210
So I took some with me

00:32:18.550 --> 00:32:20.590
Will there be another fight?

00:32:20.680 --> 00:32:22.220
Chief, you should come down

00:32:22.300 --> 00:32:25.100
Let's wait and see

00:32:31.100 --> 00:32:33.020
To congratulate Chang Wook on his victory,

00:32:35.320 --> 00:32:36.860
I'll pour him a drink

00:32:39.150 --> 00:32:42.110
You mastered Ryusu and became the magician of Jeongjingak

00:32:42.200 --> 00:32:44.370
in less than two months

00:32:45.870 --> 00:32:47.160
Congratulations

00:32:52.080 --> 00:32:55.170
I lost the fight, but...

00:32:55.250 --> 00:32:57.670
I'm glad as the Crown Prince

00:32:58.840 --> 00:33:01.090
Deho is such a good magician

00:33:01.680 --> 00:33:03.930
It's worth celebrating

00:33:04.510 --> 00:33:05.800
Have a drink

00:33:06.390 --> 00:33:09.600
and become the best magician in the country

00:33:10.180 --> 00:33:12.020
Make Daeho proud of you

00:33:12.600 --> 00:33:13.440
Chan Wook

00:33:25.820 --> 00:33:27.330
Thank you Your Highness

00:33:35.580 --> 00:33:36.920
I'll pour you some too

00:33:48.600 --> 00:33:51.680
I hope you become a wonderful king

00:34:12.040 --> 00:34:13.660
Become a great king, Your Highness

00:34:31.520 --> 00:34:32.600
That's good

00:34:32.680 --> 00:34:36.140
The Crown Prince holds no grudges

00:34:39.940 --> 00:34:42.150
Prince, heir to the throne,

00:34:42.230 --> 00:34:45.780
and a young man born under the king's star

00:34:53.450 --> 00:34:56.080
Two of Jinyeowon's relics are broken

00:34:56.870 --> 00:34:59.590
They have no energy, they are useless

00:34:59.670 --> 00:35:01.960
Burn them and scatter the ashes over Lake Gyeongjeongdaeho

00:35:02.880 --> 00:35:04.130
Yes, mother

00:35:04.720 --> 00:35:07.300
Madam, the master is back

00:35:08.140 --> 00:35:09.220
Father?

00:35:10.010 --> 00:35:11.140
Cho Young

00:35:12.180 --> 00:35:13.180
wife

00:35:13.270 --> 00:35:14.730
Father!

00:35:15.230 --> 00:35:16.310
Father!

00:35:17.020 --> 00:35:18.730
My Cho Young

00:35:20.860 --> 00:35:24.070
Let me take a look. You have become even more beautiful

00:35:33.540 --> 00:35:34.660
I'm back

00:35:38.040 --> 00:35:40.000
I found her on Volcano Island in the south

00:35:40.670 --> 00:35:42.420
She lost her parents as a child

00:35:42.500 --> 00:35:45.670
so he doesn’t remember anything about them

00:35:45.760 --> 00:35:49.760
She seems to be the same age as Boo Young

00:35:52.140 --> 00:35:54.100
Do you have any left?

00:35:54.180 --> 00:35:57.730
something from childhood?

00:36:01.310 --> 00:36:05.230
Unlike Boo Young, she has no energy,

00:36:05.320 --> 00:36:08.530
and she can't cast spells

00:36:08.610 --> 00:36:12.820
She may have lost her strength while away from Jinyeowon.

00:36:14.410 --> 00:36:17.200
But if she really is a member of the Jin family,

00:36:18.580 --> 00:36:20.670
her strength will easily return

00:36:28.470 --> 00:36:30.590
This door will show us

00:36:31.390 --> 00:36:34.180
are you really a member of our family

00:37:01.750 --> 00:37:05.090
Am I not the daughter you have been looking for for a long time?

00:37:07.050 --> 00:37:08.920
No, apparently

00:37:10.470 --> 00:37:15.260
But thank you for coming this far. They'll give you enough money to get you back.

00:37:17.180 --> 00:37:21.730
Do you think mom will be angry because of another disappointment?

00:37:22.810 --> 00:37:24.400
What should I do, father?

00:38:16.910 --> 00:38:18.030
Mother

00:38:19.830 --> 00:38:21.700
The bird in the cage died

00:38:25.540 --> 00:38:28.250
You're right. Poor

00:38:28.340 --> 00:38:31.630
Until yesterday I felt warm energy

00:38:33.050 --> 00:38:34.630
And now nothing

00:38:36.300 --> 00:38:40.390
I can see, but you still noticed first

00:38:40.470 --> 00:38:43.230
Every living thing has energy

00:38:44.100 --> 00:38:46.350
Through this energy I see the world

00:38:46.440 --> 00:38:50.980
Boo Young, may you not see what others see

00:38:52.190 --> 00:38:56.110
You are special and you see what others simply cannot see.

00:39:00.830 --> 00:39:02.990
You made me a new blindfold

00:39:03.080 --> 00:39:05.040
I want to try it on

00:39:25.430 --> 00:39:26.600
wife

00:39:28.730 --> 00:39:30.900
Don't be upset

00:39:30.980 --> 00:39:33.860
I didn't expect much when I brought her here.

00:39:35.820 --> 00:39:38.030
So you brought just anyone?

00:39:38.110 --> 00:39:41.240
So you're just trying to please me

00:39:41.910 --> 00:39:43.870
That's why we haven't been able to find her for 10 years.

00:39:47.080 --> 00:39:48.290
I...

00:39:49.040 --> 00:39:51.960
I'll start searching again

00:39:53.000 --> 00:39:54.340
Forget it

00:39:54.420 --> 00:39:57.510
Jin Moo from Jeonbugwan will help find her

00:39:57.590 --> 00:40:01.640
I thought you hated your stepbrother

00:40:01.720 --> 00:40:05.060
I hate it. But if we're talking about Boo Young,

00:40:05.140 --> 00:40:08.890
I'm ready to resort to his help

00:40:14.820 --> 00:40:15.900
Get out

00:40:16.440 --> 00:40:19.400
I'm looking for someone here

00:40:19.490 --> 00:40:20.780
Moo Deok is here right?

00:40:20.860 --> 00:40:23.120
There are a lot of people here now, come back tomorrow

00:40:25.240 --> 00:40:26.540
Pushing me

00:40:28.460 --> 00:40:29.960
Do you know who I am?

00:40:31.000 --> 00:40:32.170
And who?

00:40:34.210 --> 00:40:37.170
I am a magician of one of the supreme families of this country

00:40:39.590 --> 00:40:42.340
Show you my magic?

00:40:48.600 --> 00:40:49.980
Consider yourself lucky

00:40:50.520 --> 00:40:53.150
If I put energy in my hand, you would die

00:40:53.860 --> 00:40:56.480
Sorry. I'm sorry

00:40:57.110 --> 00:41:00.240
It's just a gisaeng house. Do you not allow visitors?

00:41:00.320 --> 00:41:03.910
Today is the festival of the magicians of Jeongjingak

00:41:04.490 --> 00:41:05.580
- Pine forest?
- Yes

00:41:05.660 --> 00:41:08.750
Even the Crown Prince is here

00:41:09.620 --> 00:41:12.250
I heard she was sold to the biggest gisaeng house in Daeho

00:41:12.920 --> 00:41:14.750
This must be the house

00:41:14.830 --> 00:41:17.920
If you give me your name, I'll introduce you

00:41:19.090 --> 00:41:21.880
Not worth it. I'll be back tomorrow

00:41:24.390 --> 00:41:25.850
What is it?

00:41:27.220 --> 00:41:28.390
Who was there?

00:41:28.970 --> 00:41:31.350
She said she's from a high family

00:41:31.430 --> 00:41:32.980
I think it's Jinyoewon

00:41:33.060 --> 00:41:36.400
She had something on her neck with the Jinyaewon crest on it.

00:41:36.480 --> 00:41:37.690
Jinyoewon?

00:41:38.190 --> 00:41:43.860
Their magicians are always rude and picky

00:41:44.700 --> 00:41:46.240
Are you okay?

00:41:46.320 --> 00:41:50.120
It doesn't hurt. She's weak for a mage

00:41:50.200 --> 00:41:53.000
What if she lied and the coat of arms is just a fake?

00:41:54.000 --> 00:41:57.710
If in Daeho you pretended to be someone from the supreme family,

00:41:57.790 --> 00:41:59.380
you can die

00:42:01.010 --> 00:42:02.470
Strange girl

00:42:11.350 --> 00:42:15.100
In Deho Fortress, magicians actually have many privileges.

00:42:16.860 --> 00:42:18.520
Moo Deok must be out there somewhere

00:42:28.580 --> 00:42:30.910
We need to live off her money at least a little

00:42:32.580 --> 00:42:34.540
If I say that I came to return it,

00:42:35.540 --> 00:42:38.750
I'm sure she'll let me stay, she's kind

00:42:40.420 --> 00:42:42.380
- Hey, who are you?
- Scared

00:42:49.600 --> 00:42:50.680
Wait for me outside

00:42:51.260 --> 00:42:52.430
Yes, Your Highness

00:42:59.940 --> 00:43:01.610
She must come out

00:43:02.980 --> 00:43:06.110
One, two, three

00:43:08.700 --> 00:43:10.580
Four, five...

00:43:11.490 --> 00:43:12.660
Your Highness

00:43:14.450 --> 00:43:15.790
Your Highness!

00:43:19.880 --> 00:43:25.170
I was touched once again

00:43:25.760 --> 00:43:27.260
your endless generosity

00:43:29.220 --> 00:43:32.470
Yes, I pretended to be kind and generous

00:43:32.560 --> 00:43:34.680
Might turn this place upside down

00:43:34.770 --> 00:43:37.940
But, as I already said, I don’t want magicians to become my enemies.

00:43:39.230 --> 00:43:41.610
What? Do you think I'm stupid?

00:43:42.520 --> 00:43:45.320
You acted very wisely and intelligently,

00:43:45.400 --> 00:43:49.070
hiding your pettiness and emotions

00:43:49.950 --> 00:43:52.740
I decided to show pettiness only to you, Won Moo Deok

00:43:52.830 --> 00:43:57.160
I can imagine how hard it was to pour him a drink,

00:43:57.250 --> 00:43:59.580
when you would like to poison

00:43:59.670 --> 00:44:02.540
That's why I rushed here as fast as I could

00:44:03.290 --> 00:44:05.510
I hate your master to the point of nausea

00:44:05.590 --> 00:44:06.710
Of course

00:44:06.800 --> 00:44:08.630
My liver is burning with hatred for him.

00:44:08.720 --> 00:44:10.470
I have no doubt

00:44:10.550 --> 00:44:12.260
And you... you support him...

00:44:13.720 --> 00:44:15.390
I don't like you either

00:44:21.230 --> 00:44:23.520
My generosity was intended for you, not for him.

00:44:26.480 --> 00:44:27.990
Won Moo Deok

00:44:28.070 --> 00:44:31.360
If you get into a fight or quarrel between us again,

00:44:32.490 --> 00:44:34.330
I'll kill you first

00:44:39.040 --> 00:44:42.960
Your Highness, if I am to die by your sword,

00:44:44.840 --> 00:44:46.630
I won't hold a grudge against you

00:44:47.760 --> 00:44:50.090
Will you serve the master anyway?

00:44:50.180 --> 00:44:51.590
What a faithful servant

00:44:51.680 --> 00:44:53.760
Maybe we should build a monument to you?

00:44:53.850 --> 00:44:57.430
I am so honored to receive your recognition.

00:44:57.520 --> 00:44:59.020
Forget it. Disappear

00:44:59.100 --> 00:45:01.480
Until I lost all my generosity and became petty again

00:45:02.480 --> 00:45:04.690
- Your Highness
- What? What again?

00:45:04.770 --> 00:45:07.110
Did you have a dying wish?

00:45:08.190 --> 00:45:11.030
How are your wounds? Are you okay?

00:45:14.120 --> 00:45:16.740
I should have asked earlier

00:45:16.830 --> 00:45:19.200
Don't worry. The attack was not strong

00:45:19.290 --> 00:45:21.160
And Ho Yeom has already patched me up

00:45:22.120 --> 00:45:25.790
You were taken by surprise because you did not expect this from my master

00:45:25.880 --> 00:45:29.340
But you, of course, are stronger than him

00:45:29.420 --> 00:45:32.800
Naturally. Who knew he was using Tansu?

00:45:32.880 --> 00:45:34.010
Fraudster

00:45:34.890 --> 00:45:36.100
Oh, you’re talking about that sachet,

00:45:36.890 --> 00:45:40.100
which she hung by the latrine pit to ward off flies?

00:45:42.890 --> 00:45:45.230
Where is the sachet I gave you?

00:45:45.310 --> 00:45:46.190
And what?

00:45:47.110 --> 00:45:50.070
Suddenly you hung it by the latrine pit to ward off flies

00:45:53.320 --> 00:45:54.450
Here

00:45:55.110 --> 00:45:58.530
Why hang such a treasure near the latrine?

00:45:58.620 --> 00:46:01.330
Exactly. I knew you wouldn't do it

00:46:02.290 --> 00:46:03.210
Well, okay

00:46:05.920 --> 00:46:07.790
Have a nice trip, Your Highness

00:46:20.100 --> 00:46:22.430
- That's enough
- That's right

00:46:22.520 --> 00:46:24.520
- Owner
- Leave me alone

00:46:24.600 --> 00:46:26.650
Wake up, master

00:46:28.020 --> 00:46:29.320
- Hey
- Just look

00:46:30.360 --> 00:46:32.530
He won't sober up until tomorrow morning

00:46:32.610 --> 00:46:34.240
Gets drunk quickly

00:46:34.320 --> 00:46:37.200
He drank everything the Crown Prince offered him.

00:46:37.280 --> 00:46:40.120
We should have helped him then. You're the only sober one here

00:46:40.200 --> 00:46:43.000
I was busy, I was singing

00:46:44.540 --> 00:46:46.080
Place the palanquin

00:46:49.290 --> 00:46:52.050
Only those who are allowed can pass here

00:46:52.630 --> 00:46:54.920
If you are not from Sosnovy Bor, leave

00:47:02.520 --> 00:47:03.890
You can't either

00:47:05.270 --> 00:47:06.600
I'm Moo Deok

00:47:07.400 --> 00:47:09.360
Master Chan's maid

00:47:09.440 --> 00:47:10.690
You know

00:47:12.110 --> 00:47:15.700
You were only allowed in because Chang Wook was a guest here before.

00:47:15.780 --> 00:47:16.820
But now everything is different

00:47:16.900 --> 00:47:19.490
He is a member of Sosnovy Bor, and you are not

00:47:20.240 --> 00:47:21.370
That's why you can't

00:47:21.450 --> 00:47:23.450
What will happen to the owner?

00:47:23.540 --> 00:47:26.910
He's very drunk. I have to take care of him

00:47:27.000 --> 00:47:30.210
Jeongjingak's servants will take care of him

00:47:33.170 --> 00:47:34.380
No!

00:47:35.880 --> 00:47:38.720
I need to be close to the owner

00:47:38.800 --> 00:47:40.050
Let me in

00:47:40.140 --> 00:47:42.810
Let her in already

00:47:42.890 --> 00:47:45.480
Uk will do something if she's not around

00:47:45.560 --> 00:47:49.560
No Jeongjingak magician has the privilege of his own maid.

00:47:51.110 --> 00:47:54.320
Chan Wook entered Pine Forest, so he must follow our rules

00:47:55.150 --> 00:47:57.240
So I really can't get in?

00:47:57.320 --> 00:47:58.780
These are the rules

00:47:59.410 --> 00:48:01.620
Go home for now

00:48:01.700 --> 00:48:03.580
I'll bring Wook home when he wakes up

00:48:03.660 --> 00:48:05.080
Chan Wook can't leave

00:48:05.750 --> 00:48:09.250
He cannot leave Sosnovy Bor until he completes his studies.

00:48:09.330 --> 00:48:10.830
This is also a rule

00:48:13.290 --> 00:48:15.590
Exactly. We stayed here too

00:48:16.380 --> 00:48:17.340
That is,

00:48:17.420 --> 00:48:20.380
I can't get in and my master can't get out?

00:48:20.470 --> 00:48:22.350
And we can't be together?

00:48:22.430 --> 00:48:25.470
Once I understand, go home with them

00:48:26.930 --> 00:48:28.140
Wait...

00:48:44.660 --> 00:48:46.620
It's Chang Wook's first day in Jeonjingak

00:48:46.700 --> 00:48:49.210
Do you want him to break the rules on his first day?

00:48:56.800 --> 00:48:59.760
Let me in!

00:49:02.260 --> 00:49:05.050
If you stand there, she won't leave

00:49:05.140 --> 00:49:07.770
If the head finds out, I'll punish her

00:49:07.850 --> 00:49:09.020
So let's go

00:49:10.310 --> 00:49:14.400
Moo Deok, go home. We'll find a way

00:49:22.360 --> 00:49:23.700
Master!

00:49:28.490 --> 00:49:30.290
Take me with you!

00:49:31.580 --> 00:49:32.870
Master!

00:49:48.310 --> 00:49:50.520
Grandpa, how have you been?

00:49:50.600 --> 00:49:51.600
Everything is fine

00:49:52.690 --> 00:49:56.230
You have grown into a beautiful girl

00:49:57.270 --> 00:50:00.150
Master Huo, one drunken magician was delivered

00:50:00.230 --> 00:50:01.610
because of his heavy breathing

00:50:01.690 --> 00:50:05.320
He's just drunk, take care of him yourself

00:50:05.410 --> 00:50:08.870
This is Chan Wook. You gave him your energy

00:50:08.950 --> 00:50:11.580
What? Chan Wook?

00:50:11.660 --> 00:50:12.830
Uk?

00:50:35.480 --> 00:50:37.270
This is that magician

00:50:39.980 --> 00:50:42.320
Yoon Ok, come here

00:50:42.400 --> 00:50:43.570
Okay

00:50:48.990 --> 00:50:52.700
His energy gates have been closed for many years, and I opened them for him

00:50:53.290 --> 00:50:56.040
I even gave him my energy. His name is Chan Wook

00:50:57.960 --> 00:50:59.040
Chan Wook?

00:50:59.130 --> 00:51:02.670
Yes. Only a month has passed and he has already mastered Ryusu

00:51:02.760 --> 00:51:03.920
He's a genius

00:51:04.420 --> 00:51:05.550
In a month?

00:51:06.880 --> 00:51:09.470
Truly a genius

00:51:23.230 --> 00:51:25.570
Well I'm very drunk

00:51:25.650 --> 00:51:28.660
I'll go to my room and go to bed

00:51:28.740 --> 00:51:30.370
Take care of him

00:51:30.950 --> 00:51:32.700
Come on

00:51:32.790 --> 00:51:34.370
Okay grandpa

00:51:50.970 --> 00:51:52.720
We met again

00:51:54.640 --> 00:51:56.850
Mr. Chan Wook

00:52:13.280 --> 00:52:15.660
I didn't come all this way to give up.

00:52:18.210 --> 00:52:19.960
I'll get inside by any means necessary

00:52:36.270 --> 00:52:37.520
Moo Deok

00:52:45.400 --> 00:52:46.610
Moo Deok

00:52:47.780 --> 00:52:51.820
Your master is dying. My head is spinning

00:53:32.490 --> 00:53:33.570
Chan Wook,

00:53:35.740 --> 00:53:37.280
if you leave me

00:53:39.450 --> 00:53:41.370
I swear I'll kill you

00:54:07.860 --> 00:54:09.280
Mr. Yul?

00:54:11.610 --> 00:54:13.650
I thought maybe you were still here

00:54:14.740 --> 00:54:15.990
And I turned out to be right

00:54:18.120 --> 00:54:19.910
I won't leave for anything

00:54:22.080 --> 00:54:24.620
I should be with the owner

00:54:27.460 --> 00:54:29.710
Sitting here won't solve the problem.

00:54:29.800 --> 00:54:32.470
Just make Uka break the rules

00:54:32.550 --> 00:54:35.090
Then all his efforts will be in vain

00:54:37.340 --> 00:54:38.640
You're right

00:54:39.850 --> 00:54:41.560
Go home, wait there

00:54:42.390 --> 00:54:43.850
I'll accompany you

00:54:54.570 --> 00:54:56.570
Tell my master

00:54:57.950 --> 00:54:59.660
that I will find a way

00:55:00.450 --> 00:55:02.950
get to Sosnovy Bor to the owner

00:55:05.330 --> 00:55:07.370
Tell him to hold out until then

00:55:09.790 --> 00:55:12.550
Fine. I'll tell you

00:56:07.690 --> 00:56:09.810
My head hurts so much

00:56:12.650 --> 00:56:14.400
It's all the prince

00:56:16.360 --> 00:56:17.650
Moo Deok

00:56:18.490 --> 00:56:21.370
- Bring some water
-Who is Moo Deok?

00:56:24.290 --> 00:56:25.370
Who are you?

00:56:25.450 --> 00:56:28.330
Don't remember? We met at the inn

00:56:30.620 --> 00:56:31.880
Don't lie

00:56:31.960 --> 00:56:34.920
You were staring at her the whole time!

00:56:35.920 --> 00:56:38.380
Ah, Ta Sun is saying something

00:56:39.130 --> 00:56:40.590
Exactly, Soon Yi

00:56:41.680 --> 00:56:42.800
Why are you here?

00:56:42.890 --> 00:56:47.310
Lady Ho is the granddaughter of Master Ho Yeom

00:56:47.390 --> 00:56:48.560
I see

00:56:50.020 --> 00:56:51.440
Is that all?

00:56:51.520 --> 00:56:52.810
If she tells Master Huo,

00:56:52.900 --> 00:56:55.730
how rude you were to her, the master will be angry with you

00:56:56.480 --> 00:56:58.650
He never liked me anyway

00:56:58.740 --> 00:56:59.860
Let him tell

00:57:03.320 --> 00:57:04.740
Well, at least thank her

00:57:04.830 --> 00:57:06.540
Mistress took care of you all night

00:57:06.620 --> 00:57:07.910
Your lady?

00:57:16.710 --> 00:57:18.210
It's better not to mention this to her.

00:57:20.130 --> 00:57:23.260
Have you met Uk yet?

00:57:24.010 --> 00:57:24.930
Yes

00:57:25.010 --> 00:57:29.980
Chan Wook helped Yoon Ok when she was in trouble

00:57:30.060 --> 00:57:31.390
I see

00:57:31.480 --> 00:57:34.690
Uk isn't the type to just help people.

00:57:35.940 --> 00:57:37.860
What are you talking about him?

00:57:40.150 --> 00:57:41.780
I heard you came from Vol Fortress

00:57:42.610 --> 00:57:46.330
Me and the gentleman's mother are from there.

00:57:47.330 --> 00:57:50.660
- I see
- Perhaps that's why

00:57:50.750 --> 00:57:52.920
you remind me of Mrs. Do Hwa

00:57:54.460 --> 00:57:57.420
I think you and my master are destined to be together

00:57:59.710 --> 00:58:02.090
If people from the same city should be similar,

00:58:02.680 --> 00:58:04.930
then you should also be similar to each other

00:58:06.930 --> 00:58:08.890
But you have nothing in common

00:58:11.020 --> 00:58:12.480
I don't understand what you're talking about

00:58:13.730 --> 00:58:15.310
Maid Kim, you are great,

00:58:15.400 --> 00:58:19.690
but sometimes you exaggerate and make hasty conclusions

00:58:20.570 --> 00:58:23.070
Are you saying I'm lying?

00:58:24.200 --> 00:58:25.530
I didn't say that

00:58:26.120 --> 00:58:27.660
Here and now

00:58:27.740 --> 00:58:31.120
They got upset and even called themselves a liar

00:58:31.200 --> 00:58:32.290
Yes, yes, of course

00:58:32.370 --> 00:58:35.710
I'm an easy to get upset liar

00:58:35.790 --> 00:58:37.880
When did I call you a liar?

00:58:37.960 --> 00:58:40.210
Now that's exactly what you said

00:58:40.300 --> 00:58:41.550
Those were your words

00:58:41.630 --> 00:58:42.920
- What's wrong with you?
- It's your fault...

00:58:43.010 --> 00:58:45.840
What kind of relationship do they have?

00:58:48.890 --> 00:58:51.520
They have a strange and peculiar relationship,

00:58:51.600 --> 00:58:53.770
tied to affection

00:58:53.850 --> 00:58:56.230
- You were the first to be upset
- You said I was lying

00:58:56.310 --> 00:58:58.270
They seem close, but there's nothing special there

00:58:58.360 --> 00:59:00.520
- You yourself sat here, repeated...
- But you see,

00:59:00.610 --> 00:59:03.820
- he's too stupid
- Keep calling me a liar

00:59:03.900 --> 00:59:05.320
And it's annoying

00:59:05.400 --> 00:59:06.410
There are no words

00:59:06.490 --> 00:59:08.660
We have evidence and witnesses

00:59:08.740 --> 00:59:10.700
Witnesses? How annoying you are!

00:59:12.750 --> 00:59:15.750
How did you and Uk meet?

00:59:18.040 --> 00:59:19.590
- Well...
- Madam

00:59:22.760 --> 00:59:24.170
Sorry for interfering

00:59:25.300 --> 00:59:26.590
Can we talk?

00:59:27.840 --> 00:59:29.390
Of course

00:59:30.510 --> 00:59:31.970
You can talk here

00:59:32.890 --> 00:59:34.930
This is personal!

00:59:35.640 --> 00:59:36.640
Let's go

00:59:38.230 --> 00:59:40.440
What's going on with them?

00:59:42.650 --> 00:59:45.820
The gentleman seems very serious

00:59:45.900 --> 00:59:47.450
That's it

00:59:47.530 --> 00:59:50.620
Judging by the way Yoon Ok follows,

00:59:50.700 --> 00:59:52.240
there is something between them

00:59:52.950 --> 00:59:54.790
- What is this?
- Who knows?

01:00:01.290 --> 01:00:03.170
I'll follow them and find out

01:00:03.250 --> 01:00:04.380
Sit down immediately!

01:00:05.130 --> 01:00:06.470
He sat down now!

01:00:07.170 --> 01:00:10.470
But this is interesting to you

01:00:10.550 --> 01:00:12.300
How can you be so slow-witted?

01:00:12.970 --> 01:00:14.220
He's hopeless

01:00:14.810 --> 01:00:16.390
It's like an incurable disease

01:00:16.480 --> 01:00:17.390
Sit down

01:00:21.270 --> 01:00:24.530
Why do they always scold me?

01:00:30.570 --> 01:00:32.120
What's happened?

01:00:33.120 --> 01:00:36.200
Have you already told everyone about what happened that day?

01:00:38.750 --> 01:00:40.750
I was uncomfortable with you following me

01:00:40.830 --> 01:00:42.420
and it’s also rude of you

01:00:42.500 --> 01:00:43.880
The beauty was not impressive

01:00:44.670 --> 01:00:46.880
And I didn't follow you

01:00:48.340 --> 01:00:49.550
No

01:00:50.260 --> 01:00:52.850
I wouldn't mention something so shameful

01:00:53.550 --> 01:00:55.140
You don't think I'm cute

01:00:55.220 --> 01:00:58.560
My beauty did not impress you and you did not follow me

01:00:59.140 --> 01:01:00.890
I'm embarrassed to even think about it

01:01:00.980 --> 01:01:02.440
So I will remain silent

01:01:02.520 --> 01:01:03.360
I have

01:01:04.110 --> 01:01:06.690
there is common sense

01:01:07.320 --> 01:01:09.700
No, that's not what I'm talking about

01:01:10.360 --> 01:01:11.280
I'm talking about the soul swallower

01:01:11.360 --> 01:01:14.120
The soul swallower who tried to kill you

01:01:14.700 --> 01:01:17.790
So it really was a soul swallower?

01:01:17.870 --> 01:01:20.370
Yes. But you can't talk about it

01:01:20.460 --> 01:01:23.830
Do me a favor. Keep it a secret

01:01:25.420 --> 01:01:29.170
You saved my life, I will fulfill your request

01:01:30.010 --> 01:01:31.090
Thank you

01:01:31.180 --> 01:01:34.260
Since we share a secret, we should at least introduce ourselves

01:01:34.970 --> 01:01:36.560
I am Ho Yoon Ok

01:01:37.180 --> 01:01:38.350
I'm Chan Wook

01:01:38.930 --> 01:01:40.850
I know. I've heard a lot

01:01:40.930 --> 01:01:42.730
Me too. This old man...

01:01:42.810 --> 01:01:44.100
That is...

01:01:44.190 --> 01:01:47.320
Master Huo always boasted about his granddaughter

01:01:47.400 --> 01:01:50.240
Did grandpa tell you something about me?

01:01:52.400 --> 01:01:54.030
You will be embarrassed

01:01:54.620 --> 01:01:55.780
Really...

01:01:56.780 --> 01:01:59.750
he walked and repeated that his granddaughter

01:01:59.830 --> 01:02:02.080
"beautiful, like a beautiful fairy." No, right?

01:02:02.660 --> 01:02:06.040
Yes, he told everyone that you dazzle with beauty

01:02:06.790 --> 01:02:07.920
Not me, unfortunately

01:02:12.470 --> 01:02:13.970
It's really awkward

01:02:14.680 --> 01:02:16.220
I can't believe it...

01:02:16.300 --> 01:02:17.140
This old man...

01:02:17.220 --> 01:02:20.720
That is, Master Huo shows such affection

01:02:20.810 --> 01:02:22.810
He said the same thing about my mom

01:02:23.690 --> 01:02:26.360
They told me I look like your mother

01:02:27.440 --> 01:02:31.190
I think this is what fairies look like to grandpa

01:02:37.410 --> 01:02:38.580
What?

01:02:39.870 --> 01:02:41.450
Doesn't look like it?

01:02:44.250 --> 01:02:45.500
I don't know

01:02:47.920 --> 01:02:49.420
I've never seen her

01:02:58.430 --> 01:03:00.180
And how would I meet a fairy?

01:03:00.260 --> 01:03:01.640
It's hard to say

01:03:03.930 --> 01:03:05.850
Have you sobered up?

01:03:05.940 --> 01:03:09.730
Yes. Heard you were around all night

01:03:11.110 --> 01:03:12.400
Yes

01:03:12.480 --> 01:03:15.820
I thought it was Moo Deok. Sorry

01:03:19.280 --> 01:03:22.330
I made tea with herbs

01:03:34.010 --> 01:03:35.720
I hoped he would drink

01:03:37.760 --> 01:03:39.340
Saejukwon

01:03:39.430 --> 01:03:41.560
Wait a minute

01:03:43.220 --> 01:03:44.680
Have you seen Moo Deok?

01:03:44.770 --> 01:03:47.140
She came with me yesterday, but she's nowhere to be found

01:03:47.730 --> 01:03:48.730
She went home

01:03:50.900 --> 01:03:53.570
Why did she leave without me?

01:03:54.530 --> 01:03:57.070
Did you leave your drunken owner and go home?

01:03:57.150 --> 01:04:00.070
Now the servants of Sosnovy Bor will take care of you

01:04:00.160 --> 01:04:03.240
Moo Deok doesn't belong to us, she can't come here

01:04:05.750 --> 01:04:06.960
Wait...

01:04:10.630 --> 01:04:12.090
Moo Deok thought

01:04:12.170 --> 01:04:15.710
she can follow Uk to Sosnovy Bor

01:04:16.920 --> 01:04:19.890
I'm sure she imagined seeing you every day.

01:04:19.970 --> 01:04:21.470
Probably upset

01:04:34.400 --> 01:04:37.610
Yes. Hope she's ok

01:04:41.070 --> 01:04:42.490
Apparently, Uk found out

01:04:43.330 --> 01:04:44.740
He's probably going to see his uncle

01:04:44.830 --> 01:04:46.870
Uncle won't allow this

01:04:50.750 --> 01:04:54.670
No magician had a personal maid

01:04:55.550 --> 01:04:58.010
And you are no exception

01:04:58.090 --> 01:04:59.130
Why?

01:04:59.720 --> 01:05:02.430
You, as an exception, kicked me out of here 20 years ago

01:05:04.260 --> 01:05:05.970
Why not make one more exception?

01:05:07.350 --> 01:05:10.520
All because Tansu taught you

01:05:12.690 --> 01:05:14.110
outside these walls?

01:05:17.070 --> 01:05:18.740
You need Moo Deok

01:05:19.400 --> 01:05:22.280
to keep in touch with the teacher?

01:05:23.570 --> 01:05:26.370
Master Li has already confirmed that I trained myself

01:05:27.580 --> 01:05:30.210
He saved you, but people are still gossiping

01:05:30.710 --> 01:05:32.120
Some even think

01:05:32.960 --> 01:05:35.710
what your father taught you, Chang Gan

01:05:38.050 --> 01:05:40.510
At first people said that I was not his son

01:05:41.880 --> 01:05:43.890
Now they are saying that my father taught me?

01:05:45.760 --> 01:05:49.520
When exceptions happen, people start chatting

01:05:50.430 --> 01:05:53.520
You quickly mastered Ryusu and used Tansu

01:05:54.480 --> 01:05:56.520
This is too unusual

01:05:59.480 --> 01:06:00.690
You...

01:06:01.650 --> 01:06:03.860
trying to get attention

01:06:05.320 --> 01:06:07.120
making people talk about themselves?

01:06:09.910 --> 01:06:13.000
The head can't be allowed to suspect Moo Deok.

01:06:13.080 --> 01:06:14.920
Otherwise he will find out that she is a nomad

01:06:16.460 --> 01:06:19.300
Okay, I understand that you are against it

01:06:21.300 --> 01:06:24.720
So will you just follow the rules?

01:06:24.800 --> 01:06:25.800
Yes

01:06:26.470 --> 01:06:28.260
It took me so long to get here

01:06:28.350 --> 01:06:32.390
I can't risk it for some maid

01:06:46.820 --> 01:06:49.870
I want to buy a spirit amulet on the black market

01:06:50.990 --> 01:06:52.250
Find me one

01:06:52.330 --> 01:06:55.420
How can you ask for such a thing when one was killed because of an amulet?

01:06:55.500 --> 01:06:59.590
If they catch you, they will kill you too

01:06:59.670 --> 01:07:03.840
I should be next to him. The owner needs me

01:07:03.920 --> 01:07:06.800
Not at all. He doesn't need you anymore

01:07:07.550 --> 01:07:10.720
He needed you when he ran away alone and trained.

01:07:10.810 --> 01:07:13.390
And now he's in Jeongjingak

01:07:13.480 --> 01:07:15.560
There are plenty of other servants there

01:07:16.140 --> 01:07:17.850
The magicians of Sosnovy Bor will also help him

01:07:17.940 --> 01:07:20.360
There's nothing more you can do for him

01:07:20.440 --> 01:07:22.110
Why does he need you?

01:07:28.870 --> 01:07:31.990
The head entrusted me to teach you the basics

01:07:32.080 --> 01:07:35.370
I'm honored to be your teacher

01:07:36.540 --> 01:07:39.000
I rely on you

01:07:42.130 --> 01:07:44.130
This is the Jeongjingak rulebook

01:07:44.210 --> 01:07:48.180
From these books you will learn about the virtues of magicians, as well as all the prohibitions

01:07:48.800 --> 01:07:50.010
You can't

01:07:50.100 --> 01:07:52.890
leave this place until you learn everything

01:07:54.980 --> 01:07:57.140
Yes. I'll follow the rules

01:07:57.770 --> 01:07:59.020
You can start

01:08:00.060 --> 01:08:01.230
read

01:08:08.610 --> 01:08:09.660
Mister

01:08:11.950 --> 01:08:13.030
Maid Kim

01:08:13.660 --> 01:08:15.200
How did you get in?

01:08:18.160 --> 01:08:19.750
I thought you were closed again

01:08:19.830 --> 01:08:22.340
in the secret room for disobedience to the head

01:08:23.210 --> 01:08:25.420
But here you are in the study hall

01:08:26.460 --> 01:08:28.430
I'm proud of you

01:08:28.510 --> 01:08:31.470
Maid Kim, you can be proud of yourself

01:08:32.220 --> 01:08:33.720
You raised this gentleman well

01:08:36.600 --> 01:08:39.890
It is worth noting that the tables are low

01:08:42.860 --> 01:08:44.520
And the chairs are uncomfortable

01:08:45.230 --> 01:08:47.030
I'm taller than the rest

01:08:47.110 --> 01:08:48.820
and I'm uncomfortable

01:08:48.900 --> 01:08:52.120
But there's nothing to be done, these are the rules

01:08:55.120 --> 01:08:59.750
What is your relationship with Ms. Huo?

01:08:59.830 --> 01:09:01.710
What did you talk to her about?

01:09:01.790 --> 01:09:04.290
Nothing special

01:09:07.130 --> 01:09:10.510
I need to read all these books. It's time for you, maid Kim

01:09:10.590 --> 01:09:13.850
Do you need some ink before class?

01:09:14.430 --> 01:09:17.720
No, I have to do everything myself

01:09:17.810 --> 01:09:19.020
These are the rules

01:09:19.100 --> 01:09:20.770
Rules. I see

01:09:21.730 --> 01:09:22.940
Okay

01:09:24.060 --> 01:09:27.190
I'll go. See you later

01:09:28.110 --> 01:09:29.280
Maid Kim,

01:09:31.110 --> 01:09:34.700
take care of Moo Deok. She's probably worried

01:09:34.780 --> 01:09:37.290
Why should she worry if you are completely fine?

01:09:37.370 --> 01:09:38.370
I think she's happy

01:09:40.000 --> 01:09:42.670
She suffered so much because of you

01:09:42.750 --> 01:09:46.210
You're a picky eater, she had to cook three times,

01:09:46.290 --> 01:09:49.170
when she was with you in the mountains. Carrying water for bathing

01:09:49.260 --> 01:09:52.430
Wash your clothes. Do you know how much work this is?

01:09:55.140 --> 01:09:57.100
Moo Deok really suffered

01:09:57.180 --> 01:10:01.390
I'll take her to see flowers and buy her something tasty.

01:10:01.980 --> 01:10:03.690
I'll take care of her

01:10:03.770 --> 01:10:06.310
She will be calm if you are not around

01:10:09.980 --> 01:10:11.190
Do you think so?

01:10:19.620 --> 01:10:21.870
Chan Wook has already reached his goal

01:10:22.370 --> 01:10:24.870
Maybe he really doesn't need me anymore

01:10:25.580 --> 01:10:27.540
He left 12 teachers

01:10:28.340 --> 01:10:31.460
It was necessary to poison him and find something to blackmail him with

01:10:32.050 --> 01:10:33.930
I trusted him too much

01:10:34.510 --> 01:10:36.550
Moo Dok!

01:10:37.390 --> 01:10:38.390
Moo Deok

01:10:38.970 --> 01:10:40.350
Do you have an amulet?

01:10:40.430 --> 01:10:43.350
I can't do this. But now you can pass the exam

01:10:44.060 --> 01:10:46.020
Do you want me to take the magician exam?

01:10:46.650 --> 01:10:48.690
Are you crazy? Don't talk nonsense

01:10:49.440 --> 01:10:52.400
Sosnovy Bor conducts an exam not for magicians

01:10:52.490 --> 01:10:55.450
They even have a competition there because of the fierce competition

01:10:55.530 --> 01:10:56.910
Competition?

01:10:56.990 --> 01:10:58.740
We hire servants in Sosnovy Bor

01:10:58.830 --> 01:11:01.540
So they just hire servants

01:11:01.620 --> 01:11:03.960
Moo Deok, you are the servant

01:11:04.790 --> 01:11:08.130
Yes, I know. But I'm no ordinary maid

01:11:08.210 --> 01:11:09.460
I refuse

01:11:10.090 --> 01:11:12.340
Why be angry?

01:11:12.420 --> 01:11:14.260
Do you know how hard it is to get there?

01:11:17.180 --> 01:11:19.260
Moo Deok, you look tired

01:11:19.350 --> 01:11:20.930
Eat before you leave

01:11:26.810 --> 01:11:27.980
Maid Kim

01:11:28.060 --> 01:11:30.520
Are you from Sosnovy Bor? Have you seen the owner?

01:11:30.610 --> 01:11:33.490
Yes. I saw it. He's fine

01:11:34.190 --> 01:11:36.650
What does he want me to do now?

01:11:36.740 --> 01:11:37.990
When will he come for me?

01:11:38.070 --> 01:11:40.160
He wants you to live well here

01:11:40.240 --> 01:11:42.410
Admired the flowers, ate sweets

01:11:43.330 --> 01:11:47.790
Did he say admire the flowers and eat sweets?

01:11:47.870 --> 01:11:48.960
Yes

01:11:53.300 --> 01:11:55.880
Didn't he say when he would come to meet me?

01:11:55.970 --> 01:11:58.260
According to the rules, he cannot go out

01:11:59.090 --> 01:12:01.510
He's determined to follow the rules

01:12:01.600 --> 01:12:04.180
I don't worry about him anymore

01:12:06.940 --> 01:12:09.980
I think Uku doesn’t need me around anymore

01:12:12.190 --> 01:12:13.270
Moo Deok,

01:12:14.530 --> 01:12:18.950
and you don’t know who our master likes?

01:12:20.740 --> 01:12:22.740
Maybe this is the girl I saw in Sosnovy Bor

01:12:22.830 --> 01:12:25.910
Girl? Is he dating someone?

01:12:26.000 --> 01:12:27.960
Well he told me

01:12:28.540 --> 01:12:30.750
that his heart belongs to a girl,

01:12:30.830 --> 01:12:34.090
which is like a bird's egg on the top of a tree

01:12:43.180 --> 01:12:46.770
And also that she has no one but him

01:12:48.270 --> 01:12:51.150
I can imagine how he worries and cares about her

01:12:51.230 --> 01:12:54.070
When a man takes care of a woman, what do you think that means?

01:12:56.320 --> 01:12:57.690
It means he's in love

01:13:01.240 --> 01:13:03.370
But it's me

01:13:09.160 --> 01:13:10.420
There were bird eggs

01:13:10.500 --> 01:13:14.630
Teacher, let's remain devoted to each other

01:13:21.050 --> 01:13:22.760
I almost died thanks to you

01:13:22.840 --> 01:13:24.180
my crazy master

01:13:28.100 --> 01:13:31.850
Our teacher-student relationship will last until you become the best,

01:13:31.940 --> 01:13:34.480
to help me get my energy back

01:13:35.610 --> 01:13:38.530
When I regain my strength and become Nak Soo again,

01:13:39.030 --> 01:13:40.990
we will no longer be teacher and student

01:13:42.450 --> 01:13:44.450
May I know why?

01:13:45.660 --> 01:13:48.700
Because then you won't have any reason to protect me anymore.

01:13:50.120 --> 01:13:51.710
And I won't have a reason

01:13:55.080 --> 01:13:56.340
be lenient with you

01:13:57.380 --> 01:13:59.340
Teacher! It's me, Chan Wook

01:14:17.150 --> 01:14:18.820
So what should we do?

01:14:20.030 --> 01:14:21.530
Everything is bad

01:14:27.160 --> 01:14:28.160
Moo Deok

01:14:30.080 --> 01:14:31.370
I miss you

01:14:37.420 --> 01:14:53.090
Thanks for watching with us!
doramamania

01:15:03.120 --> 01:15:06.080
Alchemy

01:15:03.120 --> 01:15:06.080
Shower

01:15:06.440 --> 01:15:08.240
I'm not going to teach Uka

01:15:08.320 --> 01:15:12.040
So you didn't take him under your wing, you just locked him here

01:15:12.120 --> 01:15:13.620
Help!

01:15:15.080 --> 01:15:16.710
It was definitely Moo Deok!

01:15:16.790 --> 01:15:19.250
Why does she always have to be somewhere else?

01:15:19.340 --> 01:15:20.420
Master!

01:15:21.340 --> 01:15:25.380
Why the letter? As long as it conveys your feelings...

01:15:25.470 --> 01:15:30.140
The gentleman is already in love with someone

01:15:30.220 --> 01:15:32.020
It's harder than I thought

01:15:32.100 --> 01:15:34.020
Your Highness!

01:15:34.100 --> 01:15:36.020
She was always by Uk's side

01:15:36.100 --> 01:15:39.310
You have to try to read what you can't see

01:15:39.400 --> 01:15:40.820
Moo Deok
